@startuml FSM State Interactions - Real Usage Analysis
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1976D2
  FontColor #333333
}
skinparam state.ACTIVE {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor #388E3C
}
skinparam state.UNUSED {
  BackgroundColor #FFEBEE
  BorderColor #D32F2F
  FontColor #999999
}
skinparam state.PROBLEMATIC {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #F57C00
}

title FSM State Interactions - Real Usage Analysis\n(Based on Log Analysis & Code Review)

' === ACTIVE STATES (Used in Practice) ===
state "evaluating" as EVALUATING #C8E6C9
state "exploring_deploying" as EXPLORING_DEPLOYING #C8E6C9
state "exploring_prospecting" as EXPLORING_PROSPECTING #C8E6C9 
state "exploring_returning" as EXPLORING_RETURNING #FFF3E0
state "idle_at_base" as IDLE_AT_BASE #C8E6C9

' === UNUSED STATES (Available but not used) ===
state "collecting" as COLLECTING #FFEBEE
state "returning" as RETURNING #FFEBEE

note top of COLLECTING : ❌ UNUSED\nAvailable but never\ntransitioned to in logs
note top of RETURNING : ❌ UNUSED\nReplaced by\nexploring_returning

note top of EXPLORING_RETURNING : ⚠️ PROBLEMATIC\nBot gets stuck here\nMissing transitions

' === INITIAL STATE ===
[*] --> EVALUATING : System Start

' === OBSERVED TRANSITIONS (From Log Analysis) ===
EVALUATING --> EXPLORING_DEPLOYING : EVALUATION_COMPLETE\n[hasUnexploredAreas &&\n isDroneInactive]

EXPLORING_DEPLOYING --> EXPLORING_PROSPECTING : DRONE_REACHED_TARGET\n[droneReachedTarget]

EXPLORING_PROSPECTING --> EXPLORING_RETURNING : PROSPECTING_COMPLETE\n[explorationComplete ||\n needsEmergencyReturn]

' === MISSING/PROBLEMATIC TRANSITIONS ===
EXPLORING_RETURNING --> IDLE_AT_BASE : BASE_REACHED\n[isAtBase]\n❌ NEVER TRIGGERED

IDLE_AT_BASE --> EVALUATING : REFUEL_COMPLETE |\nUNLOAD_COMPLETE\n✅ Available

' === EMERGENCY TRANSITIONS (Available) ===
EVALUATING --> EXPLORING_RETURNING : EVALUATION_COMPLETE\n[needsEmergencyReturn ||\n shouldReturnForEfficiency]
EXPLORING_DEPLOYING --> EXPLORING_RETURNING : EMERGENCY_DETECTED
EXPLORING_PROSPECTING --> EXPLORING_RETURNING : EMERGENCY_DETECTED
COLLECTING --> RETURNING : EMERGENCY_DETECTED
IDLE_AT_BASE --> EXPLORING_RETURNING : EMERGENCY_DETECTED

' === MANUAL OVERRIDES (Available) ===
EVALUATING --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE
EXPLORING_DEPLOYING --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE  
EXPLORING_PROSPECTING --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE
EXPLORING_RETURNING --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE
COLLECTING --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE
IDLE_AT_BASE --> EVALUATING : MANUAL_OVERRIDE

' === RESOURCE COLLECTION FLOW (Unused) ===
EVALUATING --> COLLECTING : EVALUATION_COMPLETE\n[hasKnownResources &&\n !hasUnexploredAreas]\n❌ NEVER USED
COLLECTING --> EVALUATING : RESOURCE_COLLECTED\n❌ NEVER USED
COLLECTING --> RETURNING : INVENTORY_FULL\n❌ NEVER USED

' === AUTO EVENT TRANSITIONS ===
EVALUATING --> EXPLORING_DEPLOYING : AUTO\n[guard(() => true)]\n✅ Main trigger

' === EVENTS LEGEND ===
note as EventsLegend
**EVENTS IDENTIFIED:**
🟢 **USED EVENTS:**
• EVALUATION_COMPLETE
• DRONE_REACHED_TARGET  
• PROSPECTING_COMPLETE
• AUTO

🔴 **UNUSED EVENTS:**
• RESOURCE_COLLECTED
• INVENTORY_FULL
• BASE_REACHED (❌ problematic)
• AREA_EXPLORED

⚠️ **PROBLEMATIC:**
• BASE_REACHED not triggered
  from exploring_returning
end note

' === GUARDS LEGEND ===
note as GuardsLegend
**GUARDS ANALYSIS:**
🟢 **USED GUARDS:**
• hasUnexploredAreas
• isDroneInactive
• droneReachedTarget
• explorationComplete
• needsEmergencyReturn

🔴 **UNUSED GUARDS:**
• hasKnownResources
• isAtMaxCapacity
• canCollectResource
• isAtBase (❌ problematic)

⚠️ **MISSING GUARDS:**
• Proper exit conditions for
  exploring_returning state
end note

' === REDUCER ANALYSIS ===
note as ReducersLegend
**REDUCERS ANALYSIS:**
🟢 **USED REDUCERS:**
• prepareEvaluating
• prepareExploring
• deployDrone (fsmDroneFleetActions)
• contextReducers.state.*

🔴 **UNUSED REDUCERS:**
• prepareCollecting
• prepareReturning (classic)
• updateInventory
• collectResource

✅ **WORKING REDUCERS:**
• All exploration-related reducers
• State preparation reducers
• Movement reducers
end note

EventsLegend -[hidden]-> GuardsLegend
GuardsLegend -[hidden]-> ReducersLegend

@enduml
